@startuml fix-findings-before
!include ../../theme.iuml
title fix-findings — today (ts_agent_helper CLI)

skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Developer" as Dev

box "Developer workstation" $ws_bg
    participant "Claude\n(fix-findings skill)" as Agent
    participant "ts-agent-helper\n(ts_agent_helper CLI)" as Helper
end box

box "Teamscale server" $ts_bg
    participant "Teamscale\nREST API" as TS
end box

Dev -> Agent : /teamscale:fix-findings <file>
Agent -[$cli_color,bold]> Helper : <size:15>**ts-agent-helper findings list <file>**</size>
activate Helper
Helper -[$drop_color,bold]> Helper : <size:15>**read .teamscale.toml**</size>\n(project id + branch);\ncreds from env / ~/.teamscale-dev.args
Helper -> TS : GET /api/v2026.2/projects/{p}/findings/list\nAuthorization: Basic base64(user:accesskey)
activate TS
TS --> Helper : findings JSON
deactivate TS
Helper --> Agent : findings JSON (stdout)
deactivate Helper

opt finding type unclear
    Agent -[$cli_color,bold]> Helper : <size:15>**ts-agent-helper findings type-descriptors**</size>\n--scope <scope> <typeId ...>
    Helper -> TS : POST /api/v2026.2/projects/{p}/finding-type-descriptors
    TS --> Helper : type descriptions
    Helper --> Agent : type descriptions
end

Agent -> Agent : triage by severity,\nread code, edit files to fix

opt false positive / toleration (after explicit user OK)
    Agent -[$cli_color,bold]> Helper : <size:15>**ts-agent-helper findings flag**</size>\n ~--type FALSE_POSITIVE|TOLERATION ~--rationale "…" <id ...>
    Helper -> TS : PUT /api/v2026.2/projects/{p}/findings/flagged
    TS --> Helper : ok
    Helper --> Agent : ok
end

Agent --> Dev : summary — fixed / tolerated / skipped

note over Agent, Helper
  The per-workstation CLI reads project + branch from
  .teamscale.toml and holds the access key locally.
end note

@enduml
